+---
+
+## SpacEagle17 — Euphoria Patches propertiesFiles (mod block lists)
+
+Community-maintained mod block ID lists used for colored light, glass tint,
+ore emission, and block emitters. Zarya imports the categories listed in
+`tools/sync-europ/mapper.json` into `shaders/block.properties` via
+`tools/sync-europ/sync.js`:
+
+- **Modded Light Source** → `block.21070`–`block.21085` (dye LPV emitters)
+- **Stained / tinted / clear glass, water, ice, slime, honey** → matching Zarya tint ids
+- **Glowing modded ores** → `block.10014` (iPBR ore emission)
+- **Torches, lanterns, lamps, portals, and other emitters** → the existing Zarya block id for that emitter
+
+Original source: https://github.com/EuphoriaPatches/propertiesFiles
+
+File headers in that repository state:
+
+```
+Copyright (c) 2026 SpacEagle17 – Licensed under the MIT License:
+https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT
+```
+
